WEBVTT
Kind: captions
Language: en

00:00:01.532 --> 00:00:05.350
Helpsters, our goal is to help Beatrice Builder build a sand

00:00:05.350 --> 00:00:06.235
castle.

00:00:06.235 --> 00:00:07.270
I like this board.

00:00:07.270 --> 00:00:09.098
[KNOCKS]

00:00:09.098 --> 00:00:09.598
It's sturdy.

00:00:09.598 --> 00:00:10.098
Yeah.

00:00:10.098 --> 00:00:11.030
I'm glad you approve.

00:00:11.030 --> 00:00:13.210
Now who's got an idea, huh?

00:00:13.210 --> 00:00:14.700
We do!

00:00:14.700 --> 00:00:15.550
Oh!

00:00:15.550 --> 00:00:18.197
Mr. Primm and Scatter, go!

00:00:18.197 --> 00:00:21.445
First we need something-- --to help us build the sand castle

00:00:21.445 --> 00:00:24.050
And we believe that something should be

00:00:24.050 --> 00:00:24.550
Sandwiches!

00:00:24.550 --> 00:00:25.307
Tools!

00:00:25.307 --> 00:00:25.975
Oh.

00:00:25.975 --> 00:00:26.710
Yours is better.

00:00:26.710 --> 00:00:27.635
Tools, tools, tools.

00:00:27.635 --> 00:00:28.365
OK, yeah.

00:00:28.365 --> 00:00:29.425
That would be great.

00:00:29.425 --> 00:00:30.490
Yeah, it would be great.

00:00:30.490 --> 00:00:31.600
So that's job one.

00:00:31.600 --> 00:00:34.030
[BELL DINGS] Get tools to build a sand castle.

00:00:34.030 --> 00:00:35.515
All right, anything else?

00:00:35.515 --> 00:00:37.787
We need sand.

00:00:37.787 --> 00:00:38.580
Job two--

00:00:38.580 --> 00:00:40.060
[BELL DINGS] --get sand.

00:00:40.060 --> 00:00:41.020
All right!

00:00:41.020 --> 00:00:46.435
And so, if we have tools and we have sand then job three is?

00:00:46.435 --> 00:00:48.220
Build a sand castle!

00:00:48.220 --> 00:00:50.140
[BELL DINGS] Yeah!

00:00:50.140 --> 00:00:54.273
Beatrice, we have our plan.

00:00:54.273 --> 00:00:56.860
(SINGING) We've got the plan, got the plan.

00:00:56.860 --> 00:00:57.890
We figured it out.

00:00:57.890 --> 00:00:58.750
We've got the plan.

00:00:58.750 --> 00:01:00.880
What happens when we've got the plan?

00:01:00.880 --> 00:01:02.560
We give a happy shout just cause we can.

00:01:02.560 --> 00:01:03.220
Woo!

00:01:03.220 --> 00:01:03.880
Cody!

00:01:03.880 --> 00:01:04.560
Beatrice!

00:01:04.560 --> 00:01:07.985
Scatter and I have tools for the sand castle.

00:01:07.985 --> 00:01:08.920
Oh!

00:01:08.920 --> 00:01:10.780
Follow me, follow me.

00:01:10.780 --> 00:01:14.920
Keep following, keep following, keep following, and-- followed!

00:01:14.920 --> 00:01:17.510
Scatter, the tools we have assembled.

00:01:17.510 --> 00:01:18.010
Oh!

00:01:18.010 --> 00:01:19.925
They're all in this bucket.

00:01:19.925 --> 00:01:20.425
Yes.

00:01:20.425 --> 00:01:20.980
Great.

00:01:20.980 --> 00:01:22.270
There's a ruler.

00:01:22.270 --> 00:01:23.515
Mmm-hmm, yes.

00:01:23.515 --> 00:01:27.070
There's a wrench, and a pencil.

00:01:27.070 --> 00:01:27.715
Mmm, yes.

00:01:27.715 --> 00:01:29.140
That's a tool you use to draw.

00:01:29.140 --> 00:01:31.860
How can those tools help Beatrice build the sandcastle,

00:01:31.860 --> 00:01:32.665
huh?

00:01:32.665 --> 00:01:33.400
Oh!

00:01:33.400 --> 00:01:35.440
Goodness, Cody is right!

00:01:35.440 --> 00:01:37.505
These tools don't help at all!

00:01:37.505 --> 00:01:38.005
Nuh-uh.

00:01:38.005 --> 00:01:39.970
We need to think of something that will help

00:01:39.970 --> 00:01:42.745
shape the sand into a castle.

00:01:42.745 --> 00:01:44.140
Hmm.

00:01:44.140 --> 00:01:45.160
Wait a minute.

00:01:45.160 --> 00:01:47.050
Bucket.

00:01:47.050 --> 00:01:48.790
Bucket of sand.

00:01:48.790 --> 00:01:50.320
Sandcastle.

00:01:50.320 --> 00:01:51.430
Bucket--

00:01:51.430 --> 00:01:53.080
What is happening?

00:01:53.080 --> 00:01:55.585
He's getting an idea.

00:01:55.585 --> 00:01:57.550
We can fill the bucket with sand,

00:01:57.550 --> 00:01:59.815
then flip the bucket over.

00:01:59.815 --> 00:02:03.340
That is a great idea, Mr. Primm!

00:02:03.340 --> 00:02:06.685
But can I get another bucket that looks a little different?

00:02:06.685 --> 00:02:09.190
Oh yeah, because that way parts of the castle

00:02:09.190 --> 00:02:10.649
can look a little different.

00:02:10.649 --> 00:02:11.740
Exactly!

00:02:11.740 --> 00:02:15.160
OK, so how about the rule is if a bucket is

00:02:15.160 --> 00:02:17.470
a different shape than this bucket, then

00:02:17.470 --> 00:02:19.335
that is a bucket we want, huh?

00:02:19.335 --> 00:02:19.835
Yeah.

00:02:19.835 --> 00:02:20.980
OK.

00:02:20.980 --> 00:02:22.630
Got one!

00:02:22.630 --> 00:02:24.775
This appears to be the same shape.

00:02:24.775 --> 00:02:28.220
Then that's not a bucket we want!

00:02:28.220 --> 00:02:28.720
Nuh-uh.

00:02:28.720 --> 00:02:31.157
Oh, here's one.

00:02:31.157 --> 00:02:33.467
Oh, it's a different shape.

00:02:33.467 --> 00:02:37.328
Then that's a bucket we want.

00:02:37.328 --> 00:02:38.620
Get tools to make a sandcastle?

00:02:38.620 --> 00:02:39.560
[BELL DINGS]

00:02:39.560 --> 00:02:40.060
Check!

00:02:40.060 --> 00:02:43.140
One job done, two more to go.

00:02:43.140 --> 00:02:43.640
Yeah!

00:02:43.640 --> 00:02:44.140
Cody!

00:02:44.140 --> 00:02:44.950
Beatrice!

00:02:44.950 --> 00:02:46.120
Good news.

00:02:46.120 --> 00:02:47.582
Come with me!

00:02:47.582 --> 00:02:48.665
Come on!

00:02:48.665 --> 00:02:52.330
So, uh, where is the sandbox?

00:02:52.330 --> 00:02:53.552
Right here.

00:02:53.552 --> 00:02:55.757
Oh.

00:02:55.757 --> 00:02:58.088
OK, I see what happened here.

00:02:58.088 --> 00:03:01.210
Yeah, Heart, we need a box with enough sand

00:03:01.210 --> 00:03:02.860
to build a sand castle.

00:03:02.860 --> 00:03:04.960
You know like something like a sandbox

00:03:04.960 --> 00:03:08.920
you see on a playground with lots of sand.

00:03:08.920 --> 00:03:09.790
Oh!

00:03:09.790 --> 00:03:11.130
Wait here.

00:03:11.130 --> 00:03:11.974
Huh?

00:03:11.974 --> 00:03:16.000
[HEART CHUCKLES] [SAWING AND HAMMERING SOUNDS]

00:03:16.000 --> 00:03:17.655
Whoa!

00:03:17.655 --> 00:03:20.310
Ta-da!

00:03:20.310 --> 00:03:21.270
Do you like it?

00:03:21.270 --> 00:03:22.605
It's perfect!

00:03:22.605 --> 00:03:23.505
Mmm-hmm!

00:03:23.505 --> 00:03:24.300
Get sand?

00:03:24.300 --> 00:03:25.405
[BELL DINGS]

00:03:25.405 --> 00:03:26.660
Check!

00:03:26.660 --> 00:03:29.145
One sand castle coming up!

00:03:29.145 --> 00:03:30.440
All right!

00:03:30.440 --> 00:03:31.944
Fill the bucket with sand--

00:03:31.944 --> 00:03:32.818
Yeah, yeah, yeah

00:03:32.818 --> 00:03:36.410
--and, ta-daaa!

00:03:36.410 --> 00:03:36.910
Oh.

00:03:36.910 --> 00:03:37.930
It's another lump.

00:03:37.930 --> 00:03:39.080
No.

00:03:39.080 --> 00:03:40.950
Aw, the sand isn't sticking together.

00:03:40.950 --> 00:03:43.822
I'll never be able to build anything with sand.

00:03:43.822 --> 00:03:45.930
Whoa, whoa, whoa.

00:03:45.930 --> 00:03:48.015
Don't you give up Beatrice.

00:03:48.015 --> 00:03:49.080
Maybe relax.

00:03:49.080 --> 00:03:50.745
Have a drink of water.

00:03:50.745 --> 00:03:52.520
Oh, I have water.

00:03:52.520 --> 00:03:53.280
Ope!

00:03:53.280 --> 00:03:57.517
Oh, sorry, Beatrice, I got your sand all wet.

00:03:57.517 --> 00:03:59.040
Yes, but look!

00:03:59.040 --> 00:04:02.460
Now that it's wet, it's sticking together.

00:04:02.460 --> 00:04:04.872
I bet that'll work with the bucket.

00:04:04.872 --> 00:04:08.820
Beatrice, try making a sandcastle now.

00:04:08.820 --> 00:04:17.816
Fill the bucket, pat it down real good, and ta-daa!

00:04:17.816 --> 00:04:19.730
Now that's something, yeah?

00:04:19.730 --> 00:04:20.230
Yea!

00:04:20.230 --> 00:04:21.349
Yes sir!

00:04:21.349 --> 00:04:25.940
OK, fill the bucket with sand, pat it down real good again--

00:04:25.940 --> 00:04:26.667
Uh-huh.

00:04:26.667 --> 00:04:32.381
--and Ta-da!

00:04:32.381 --> 00:04:33.264
Yea!

00:04:33.264 --> 00:04:34.740
That looks so great!

00:04:34.740 --> 00:04:36.705
OK, OK, one more.

00:04:36.705 --> 00:04:39.225
OK.

00:04:39.225 --> 00:04:40.465
Ta-da!

00:04:40.465 --> 00:04:41.206
Wow.

00:04:41.206 --> 00:04:43.505
That is so, so, so cool.

00:04:43.505 --> 00:04:45.670
OK, let me just make a few final touches.

00:04:45.670 --> 00:04:48.020
And-- done.

00:04:48.020 --> 00:04:49.703
[TRIUMPHANT MUSIC] Wow.

00:04:49.703 --> 00:04:50.586
Whoa.

00:04:50.586 --> 00:04:53.615
Now that is a castle made of sand.

00:04:53.615 --> 00:04:55.160
Wait, one last thing.

00:04:59.002 --> 00:05:00.528
Build a sand castle?

00:05:00.528 --> 00:05:01.752
[BELL DINGS] Check!

00:05:01.752 --> 00:05:04.940
All the jobs are done.

